{
  "name": "Automated UK Companies House & FCA Corporate KYB Compliance Auditor — Daily B2B Data & Compliance Pipeline",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Automated UK Companies House & FCA Corporate KYB Compliance Auditor Pipeline (Daily B2B M2M Workflow)\n\n**Overview:**\nAudits United Kingdom corporate entities against UK Companies House CRN records, GLEIF UK LEI registrations, SIC codes, registered office addresses, and FCA regulatory status. Computes a deterministic KYB Compliance Score (0-100) for onboarding.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [b2b-quant-apis/uk-fca-companies-house-kyb-compliance-auditor](https://apify.com/b2b-quant-apis/uk-fca-companies-house-kyb-compliance-auditor)\n\n### Quick Setup (2 Minutes):\n1. Create a free Apify account and copy your personal token from **Settings -> Integrations**.\n2. Open the **Apify Engine: uk-fca-companies-house-kyb-compliance-auditor** HTTP Request node and configure a **Header Auth** credential with:\n   - **Name:** `Authorization`\n   - **Value:** `Bearer <YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN_HERE>`\n3. Customize the JSON input payload in the HTTP Request node and set your destination Webhook/Slack URL.\n4. Toggle the workflow **Active** to run automatically every morning at 07:00 AM!",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "190d52df-eec6-53f9-8861-5184f8b4c796",
      "name": "Setup Instructions & Architecture",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 7 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "3f310568-fd6b-54dc-a5ab-765e9bba6343",
      "name": "Daily 07:00 AM Schedule Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        520
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
